  "candidate": "theorem InitsUpdatesComm\n  {P : PureExpr} {\u03c3 \u03c3' \u03c3'' : SemanticStore P}\n  {ks ks' : List P.Ident} {vs vs' : List P.Expr} :\n  UpdateStates \u03c3 ks vs \u03c3' \u2192\n  InitStates \u03c3' ks' vs' \u03c3'' \u2192\n  \u2203 \u03c3\u2081,\n    \u03c3\u2081 = (updatedStates \u03c3 ks' vs') \u2227\n    InitStates \u03c3 ks' vs' \u03c3\u2081 \u2227\n    UpdateStates \u03c3\u2081 ks vs \u03c3'' := by\n  intro hu hi\n  refine \u27e8_, rfl, updatedStatesInit (InitStatesLength hi)\n    (UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' (InitStatesNotDefined hi) hu)\n    (InitStatesNodup hi), ?_\u27e9\n  rw [InitStatesUpdated hi, UpdateStatesUpdated hu]\n  unfold updatedStates\n  rw [updatedStatesComm]\n  \u00b7 apply updatedStatesUpdate (UpdateStatesLength hu)\n    apply updatedStatesDefMonotone\n    exact UpdateStatesDefined' hu\n  \u00b7 simp [List.unzip_zip, UpdateStatesLength hu, InitStatesLength hi,\n      List.Disjoint]\n    intro k hk hk'\n    simpa [InitStatesNotDefined hi k hk'] using UpdateStatesDefined hu k hk"
